msgstr "Miorina amin'ny NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Ny anarana tianao homena ity UPS ity. Ho an'ny fitaovana APCUPSD sy NUT, hisy fitaovana Cacti mifandraika aminy hoforonina ho azy amin'ny fampiasana io anarana io. Ho an'ny UPS miorina amin'ny SNMP, tsy maintsy mamorona ny fitaovana Cacti aloha ianao."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "UPS vaovao"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Famaritana ny UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Famaritana amin'ny antsipiriany kokoa momba ity UPS ity raha ilaina."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Karazana UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Ny karazana UPS arahinao maso."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "ID-n'ny Poller"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Ny Poller manara-maso sy misy ity UPS ity"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny toerana"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Ny toerana misy ity UPS ity."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tsy misy"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Toerana"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Ny toerana ara-batana misy ny fitaovana. Ity lahatsoratra malalaka ity dia mety ho efitrano, toerana amin'ny talantalana (rack), sns."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Fitaovana Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Ho an'ny UPS miorina amin'ny SNMP, safidio ny fitaovana Cacti hampiasaina amin'ny fahazoan-dalana SNMP. Raha tsy izany, safidio ny Tsy misy, dia ny plugin UPS no hamorona ny fitaovana ho azy ho anao."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Famoronana ho azy amin'ny fanangonana voalohany"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Velona"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Mariho raha hanomboka avy hatrany ny fanangonana angona."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Fampahalalana momba ny APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano izay mampandeha ny apcupsd na ny mpizara NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Seranana TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Ampidiro ny seranana TCP ho an'ity UPS ity. Ny an'ny apcupsd dia 3551 amin'ny mahazatra ary ny an'ny NUT dia 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Fe-potoana farany (segondra)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Ny faharetan'ny fiandrasan'ny poller ny apcupsd na ny mpizara NUT alohan'ny hijanonana amin'ity UPS ity, manomboka amin'ny 1 ka hatramin'ny 120 segondra. Ny UPS miorina amin'ny SNMP dia mampiasa ny fe-potoana SNMP kosa."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Safidy NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny UPS ao amin'ny NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny UPS ao amin'ny mpizara NUT, araka ny asehon'ny \"upsc -l\" (ilay ampahany alohan'ny @ ao amin'ny ups@host). Ny mpizara NUT iray dia afaka manompo UPS maromaro."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Anaran'ny mpampiasa NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Tsy voatery. Ny kaonty upsd.users ampiasaina amin'ny fanamarinana. Avelao ho banga raha fidirana famakiana ihany tsy mitonona anarana, izay fomba mahazatra fanaraha-maso ny mpizara NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Tenimiafina NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Ny tenimiafina ho an'ny anaran'ny mpampiasa NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Mampiasa TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Afeno amin'ny STARTTLS ny fifandraisana alohan'ny handefasana ny fahazoan-dalana. Hamarinina ny fanamarinana sy ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano an'ny mpizara NUT, ka tsy maintsy atokisan'ny poller Cacti ilay fanamarinana, na azonao tondroina eto ambany ny rakitra CA / fanamarinana."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Rakitra CA / Fanamarinana"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Tsy voatery. Ny lalana feno ao amin'ny poller Cacti mankany amin'ny rakitra PEM mitahiry ny fanamarinana CA (na ny fanamarinan'ny mpizara nosoniavin'ny tenany ihany) hanamarinana ny mpizara NUT, ohatra /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano etsy ambony dia tsy maintsy mifanaraka amin'ny fanamarinana."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Ekeo ny fanamarinana nosoniavin'ny tenany ihany"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Ekeo daholo izay fanamarinana rehetra nefa tsy manamarina azy. Mbola voafehy sy miafina ny fifandraisana, saingy tsy voamarina ny mpizara NUT, ka mety ho vitan'ny mpisakana eny antenatenany ny mamaky ny fahazoan-dalana NUT. Tsara kokoa ny mampiasa ny rakitra CA / Fanamarinana etsy ambony."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Safidy SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano misy ny mpandraharaha SNMP."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Tsy azo ovana ny ID-n'ny Poller raha mbola mifandray amin'ny fitaovana Cacti ny UPS. Ovao ao amin'ny fitaovana kosa ny poller."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Tsy hita ny môdely UPS! Tsy afaka manao dika mitovy."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Tsy misy amin'ireo UPS voafidy no mbola manana fitaovana Cacti, ka tsy nandeha ny fanamboarana kisary ho azy. Misy fitaovana foronina amin'ny fanangonana voalohany mahomby."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Nandeha ny fanamboarana kisary ho azy ho an'ny UPS %d. UPS %d no mbola tsy manana fitaovana Cacti ary nodikaina."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es)."
msgstr "Nandeha ny fanamboarana kisary ho azy ho an'ny UPS %d."

#: upses.php
msgid "(no Cacti Device yet)"
msgstr "(mbola tsy misy fitaovana Cacti)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following UPS.  Note, all Devices will be disassociated from this UPS."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to Delete all following UPSes.  Note, all devices will be disassociated from this UPS."
msgstr[0] "Tsindrio ny 'Tohizo' mba hamafana ity UPS manaraka ity. Marihina fa hesorina tsy hifandray amin'ity UPS ity ny Fitaovana rehetra."
msgstr[1] "Tsindrio ny 'Tohizo' mba hamafana ireo UPS manaraka rehetra. Marihina fa hesorina tsy hifandray amin'ity UPS ity ny fitaovana rehetra."

